{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738960124521086987","content":"The mechanical dog stands in front of Leaf. Rockman stands beside Rush","created_at":"2020-08-01T08:16:51.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739033897639215144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738960124521086987","content":"She nods and watches them leave before turning back to the ocean. Slowly, she walks closer to the waves, kneeling down so she can feel the water on both bare hands and feet. She closes her eyes and presses her hand into the wet sand where the water meets the land, searching for a pulse. She can feel the waves pushing and pulling the soft sand from underneath her hand. She lets Melora's ocean guide her breathing, in and out with the waves, but even with her help Leaf's tears still mix with the ocean. ||Please come back...||","created_at":"2020-08-01T08:17:13.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739033990257836052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
